= AI Installation Guide — __APP_NAME__
:toc:

[IMPORTANT]
====
*This file is written for an AI assistant.* A person asked you to set up
__APP_NAME__ (https://github.com/__REPO_SLUG__). Follow these steps in order. Run
each command yourself if you can run commands; otherwise give the person one
command at a time and wait for its output. Never skip the privacy notice (step 2)
or the verification (step 6). If a step fails, go to <<if-a-step-fails>>; do not
